      "espana": "A crossroads of contrasts, immensely rich in ancestral textile traditions, elite classic tailoring, and fine leather craftsmanship that have endured over centuries across diverse peninsular corners.",
      "marruecos": "Mystical home of the ancient red pottery from the Rif mountains, masterful tanners of the imperial medinas, and looms of impossible colors. A vibrant legacy, purely handmade and passed from mothers to daughters.",
